From: Val Packett <val@packett.cool>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 02:14:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/11] drm/msm/a6xx: Import a680 hwcg sequence from kgsl

The initialization sequence for a680 differs from a640 in a few places.
Match downstream by using this a680 specific one.

Signed-off-by: Val Packett <val@packett.cool>

---
6.18.60 adaptation: a6xx_catalog.c already includes a6xx_gmu.xml.h, so
the include addition from the original patch is dropped; the A680 catalog
entry context carries gbif_cx from patch 2/5. Upstream posting:
https://patchew.org/linux/20261103011358.65398-1-val@packett.cool/

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_catalog.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_catalog.c
index 32cce8cf5eca1002e3adc837501dfbdc3c76ff78..2451c9ecee8a1a4646bb6a3b95217ef54e92c835 100644
